  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[Cadd9] (riff)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[Cadd9]It's not the same without you up here\nCan't find my wheels\nYour absence is what breeds this fear\nWarm breath and all it steals\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[C#sus2]You can't know how it feels to be in [E]here [G#m] [F#]\n[C#sus2]All the dark horse fields, befrien[E]din' me [G#m] [F#]\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[Cadd9]Playin' ain't the same without you here\nWe've come to hate the golden rule\nCannot seem to make the dots connect\nThe morning light don't show you near\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[C#sus2]You can't know what it's like to bleed from [E]here [G#m] [F#]\n[C#sus2]The blackened world grows white, it goes no[E]where [G#m] [F#]\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[Em]Oooooohhhh.... [Cmaj7] [Asus2] [Cmaj7]\n[Em]Oooooohhhh.... [Cmaj7] [Asus2] [Cmaj7]\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[Cadd9]Death ain't the same without you, dear\nI make the others run and hide\nNew york streets seem to make it worse\nAll this noise inside the quiet\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[C#sus2]I can't hold on, the weight you [E]bear [G#m] [F#]\n[C#sus2]My body's broken fast, please lift me [E]up [G#m] [F#]\n[C#sus2]You can't know what it's like to be in[E]side [G#m] [F#]\n[C#sus2]The fading melodies can't beat my [E]need [G#m] [F#]\n\n{section: Outro}\n[Cadd9]I'm not the same without you here\nHow can I quit to be there\nSit and stare...\nStare...\nBegging for a prayer..."
